WEBVTT

00:15:57.013 --> 00:16:00.089
lawama ilhamishwa kutoka kwa Thordis kwangu.

00:16:01.331 --> 00:16:02.482
Mara nyingi mno,

00:16:02.506 --> 00:16:07.090
wajibu ni ulitokana
kwa waathirika wa kike wa ukatili wa kijinsia,

00:16:07.114 --> 00:16:09.625
na si kwa wanaume ambao kutunga yake.

00:16:10.736 --> 00:16:11.886
Mara nyingi mno,

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:16.992
kuukana ukweli huwaacha wahusika mbali na ukweli.

00:16:18.984 --> 00:16:21.764
Kuna mazungumzo katika umma sasa,

00:16:22.371 --> 00:16:24.550
na kama watu wengi,

00:16:24.574 --> 00:16:27.164
tuna imanishwa na hamasa ndogo

00:16:27.188 --> 00:16:29.908
kwa majadiliano haya magumu
lakini muhimu.